&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>For example, if we want to get a path like &amp;ldquo;Users/ruoke&amp;rdquo;, we can create it using&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Maven</title><link>https://ruokezhang.github.io/post/maven/</link><pubDate>Tue, 28 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://ruokezhang.github.io/post/maven/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="basic">Basic
